{"version":1,"content":"<p>天王郭富城方媛（Moka）向來熱愛在社交平台分享生活點滴，她上載多張日常美照，並配文「小朋友的快速突襲」，記錄與兩名愛女的溫馨互動。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;相片中，身穿棕色復古圖案針織外套的方媛原本正悠閒地享受下午</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.429400+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180068+00:00","content_hash":"c6ab2e820c279a0dc1be38f297412cc30d578098a7ebd1611cb3681dc2f0f349","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}